      "Next is building approval. In Lagos, planning permits come through the physical planning authority, and Abuja has its own development control department. Other states have their own planning offices. Building without approval is how people end up with a red X painted on a nearly finished house. A soil test is also worth it, especially in swampy or reclaimed areas. The soil decides your foundation type, and the wrong foundation is the most expensive mistake you can make.",
